type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"table","children":[{"type":"text","value":"table"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/interfaces/Table_Internal.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Table_Internal"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"updater","children":[{"type":"text","value":"updater"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/Updater.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Updater"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/ColumnFiltersState.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ColumnFiltersState"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"table_setColumnFilters(table, (old) => old.filter((filter) => filter.id !== 'age'))","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-table-setcolumnfilters","text":"Function: table_setColumnFilters()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"table","text":"table","level":3},{"id":"updater","text":"updater","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: table\\_setColumnFilters()\n\n```ts\nfunction table_setColumnFilters<TFeatures, TData>(table, updater): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.utils.ts:283](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.utils.ts#L283)\n\nRoutes a column filter updater through the table's filter change handler.\n\nThe resolved filters are cleaned before they are emitted: filters for known\ncolumns are removed when their filter function says the value should be\nauto-removed.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### table\n\n[`Table_Internal`](../../index/interfaces/Table_Internal.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### updater\n\n[`Updater`](../../index/type-aliases/Updater.md)\\<[`ColumnFiltersState`](../../index/type-aliases/ColumnFiltersState.md)\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntable_setColumnFilters(table, (old) => old.filter((filter) => filter.id !== 'age'))\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: table_setColumnFilters\ntitle: table_setColumnFilters\n---\n\n# Function: table\\_setColumnFilters()\n\n```ts\nfunction table_setColumnFilters<TFeatures, TData>(table, updater): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.utils.ts:283](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/columnFilteringFeature.utils.ts#L283)\n\nRoutes a column filter updater through the table's filter change handler.\n\nThe resolved filters are cleaned before they are emitted: filters for known\ncolumns are removed when their filter function says the value should be\nauto-removed.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### table\n\n[`Table_Internal`](../../index/interfaces/Table_Internal.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n### updater\n\n[`Updater`](../../index/type-aliases/Updater.md)\\<[`ColumnFiltersState`](../../index/type-aliases/ColumnFiltersState.md)\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntable_setColumnFilters(table, (old) => old.filter((filter) => filter.id !== 'age'))\n```\n"}
